### Greedy

# dev tmp-storage
legacy/tmp-storage/*
!legacy/tmp-storage/readme.txt

# local session hand-over notes (not shared)
resume-claude-session.md

# Gradle build (root build and build-logic); build/ is ignored above
.gradle/
.kotlin/
!gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.jar
# ... but not build-logic's sources in package org.kduda.greedy.build
!/build-logic/src/**/build/

# generated secrets for the local services (.env.tmp while make writes .env)
.env
.env.tmp
